(a) substantial original engineering changes the core architecture or workflows
AND introduces a materially different major feature set; the result must be
clearly distinguishable from a LocalCloud clone;
(b) the project uses a distinct name and identity and does not imply endorsement;
(c) the README and application About/credits prominently identify LocalCloud,
Ilya Gavrilov, the original repository URL from which the code was obtained,
and the AI-assisted origin, and summarize the substantial changes;
(d) this license and the original notices remain with all retained LocalCloud
first-party portions, and no more restrictive conditions are applied to those
portions; original additions may have a separate compatible license;
(e) third-party licenses and applicable law are respected.
A mere quantity of changed lines is insufficient. When a proposed release does
not clearly meet these conditions, obtain the author's written permission before
publication. Commercial derivatives require separate written permission.

Suggested attribution:
